---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base lang="zh" title="404" path="/404.html" altPath={null} noindex bodyClass="dotgrid">
  <main class="lost" id="main">
    <div class="code404">404</div>
    <h1>这一页不在桌面上</h1>
    <p>链接可能写错了，或者这篇文章换了地址。</p>
    <p lang="en">This page is not on the desk. The link may be mistyped, or the post has moved.</p>
    <p><a class="chip-btn" href="/posts/">全部文章</a> <a class="chip-btn" href="/en/posts/" lang="en">All posts</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
